  "fidelityScope": "Two full public-domain Qualla originals actually inspected: DimiTalen CC0 2017 view from the Reichstag and LeonhardLenz CC0 2022 east/front rally view. They show the five passages, Doric columns, attic, side porticoes and quadriga from complementary angles. The blue/yellow facade projection in the rally photo is temporary light, not sandstone coloration; crowds obscure the lower facade. Earlier attribution-licensed images are excluded. Photos are visual references only; no image is embedded as a texture. Mapped geometry and terrain have their separate source provenance."
